  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">학생 탐구중에 관찰한건데 아세톤을 드라이아이스에 부었더니 제법 시간흐른후 끓는? 현상이 관찰되네요. 비커에 옮겨담아도 제법 오래 끓습니다. <br>사용한 온도계가 -40도까지만 측정가능한데, <br>아마 -50~ -60도 되는 듯 합니다. <br>이걸 어떻게 설명해야할까요? <br>아세톤의 끓는점은 56도라는데...</p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rvaeiep2ub2ub6xhr64gbemzp@my?service=daum_cafe\" data-video-host=\"kakaotv\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"1440\" data-video-height=\"1920\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://thumb.kakaocdn.net/dna/kamp/source/rvaeiep2ub2ub6xhr64gbemzp/thumbs/5.jpg?credential=TuMuFGKUIcirOSjFzOpncbomGFEIdZWK&amp;expires=33244162804&amp;signature=hFh%2BhMabvTDSZE%2BR%2BzN2KEeCkGM%3D\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthFull\" data-video-origin-width=\"1440\" data-video-origin-height=\"1920\"><iframe src=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rvaeiep2ub2ub6xhr64gbemzp?service=daum_cafe&amp;f=p&amp;ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InJ2YWVpZXAydWIydWI2eGhyNjRnYmVtenAiLCJ0aWQiOiI3NGE2YzJlOC1mNWNiLTQwOTMtYmZkYi0wZjY5YzM3NTY5N2EiLCJhcHBfaWQiOiJkYXVtX2NhZmUiLCJleHAiOjE3ODYxODc0MzB9.b6ksbZsEmn7lAHr7DQ40PwK3EwOXWKXtfNM5zO27w33HXS7TcLaFq8T5gf0yXK7fUr8r4Wuwd27FzJbB1BuDSQ&amp;autoplay=0\" width=\"1440\" height=\"1920\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\" allow=\"encrypted-media\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rvatu5qe916w3sjqfthqv5t0l@my?service=daum_cafe\" data-video-host=\"kakaotv\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"1440\" data-video-height=\"1920\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://thumb.kakaocdn.net/dna/kamp/source/rvatu5qe916w3sjqfthqv5t0l/thumbs/2.jpg?credential=TuMuFGKUIcirOSjFzOpncbomGFEIdZWK&amp;expires=33244162751&amp;signature=gVhVQwIZHhapfAsCEflgfk%2B6Jls%3D\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthFull\" data-video-origin-width=\"1440\" data-video-origin-height=\"1920\"><iframe src=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rvatu5qe916w3sjqfthqv5t0l?service=daum_cafe&amp;f=p&amp;ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InJ2YXR1NXFlOTE2dzNzanFmdGhxdjV0MGwiLCJ0aWQiOiI5ZjZiOWFmNS1iZjNhLTRhMGUtOTM0OC1iNDFlNjg4YjE1NGIiLCJhcHBfaWQiOiJkYXVtX2NhZmUiLCJleHAiOjE3ODYxODc0MzB9.r4zzf_sxqJ_zjvo5GSD95zcqqajBT-jNuWsBtFGGcxYZzVr-eoYq9uvQu2GHkQkwQYeFT-MCuXROiDmAQ_SGoA&amp;autoplay=0\" width=\"1440\" height=\"1920\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\" allow=\"encrypted-media\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><b>실험과정 추가</b></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">배스킨라빈스&#160;케익&#160;스티로폼&#160;박스에&#160;조약돌&#160;크기&#160;드라이아이스&#160;조각을&#160;많이&#160;넣고,&#160;아세톤을&#160;200ml정도&#160;부었습니다.&#160;제법&#160;시간이&#160;지난후,&#160;스티로폼&#160;박스에서&#160;끓는?(기포발생)&#160;현상이&#160;보였고,&#160;액체만&#160;걸러&#160;비커에&#160;옮겨&#160;담았습니다.&#160;비커에&#160;옮겨담는&#160;과정에서&#160;시각적으로는&#160;드라이아이스&#160;조각이&#160;보이지는&#160;않았습니다.</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
